{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名20歲內地男子涉向一間本地專上學院及入境處提交虛假海外學院學歷證明，被控一項以欺騙手段取得服務罪，被告早前承認控罪，今日（20日）於觀塘裁判法院被判監禁兩個月。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.823712+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T06:57:39.168442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684168+00:00","content_hash":"5697418d034adc47820ce8c1247b5c97b7207b20555f0e86235462e6a1dea98e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}